  claims:
  - He is Oh Sangchul, manager of the Seoul Daily's Mapo branch.
  - From October the branch takes the subscription fee by transfer, not at the door.
  - "October to December costs \u20A954,000: Nuri Bank 110-457-803312, in his name."
  - If it isn't paid by 17:00, the paper stops coming tomorrow.
