      deliver: []
      pauseAfter: 0.4
    - speaker: 0
      text: October to December comes to 54,000 won. Please send it to Nuri Bank
        110-457-803312. The account is in my name, Oh Sangchul.
      spoken: October to December comes to fifty four thousand won. Please send it
